  "title": "Increase str_addr_len to accomidate new longer string name after MR 16417",
  "description": "The replacement of \"Slave\" with \"Peripheral\" in MR 16417 caused the overall length requirement for display to increase.\n\nWithout this change, the Access Address is truncated when combined with the \"Peripheral_\" string as shown below:\n![image](/uploads/4874cc745b4644de722b9bef2ad864da/image.png)\n\nWith the change it behaves as expected, and displays the full AA:\n![image](/uploads/46e99fa4fa27afb66e71961f4fa0b787/image.png)\n\nThis was tested via local build and opening the same file before and after.",
